01-dashboard/dashboard.html
01-dashboard/dashboard_files/
04-outputs/dashboard/data.json
# and the page's stamped memory of its own past renders: one small file
# every twenty minutes, capped at 400, local evidence rather than source.
04-outputs/dashboard/history/
# and the rest of the page's generated feed: the analysis emitter's tables,
# the shrunken copies of the research figures, and the three interactive lab
# dashboards. All are rebuilt by scripts/render_dashboard.sh from code and
# figures that ARE committed, and together they run to about 25 MB a render.
04-outputs/dashboard/analysis.json
04-outputs/dashboard/figures.json
04-outputs/dashboard/figures/
01-dashboard/analysis/


