# TradingAgents run logs from 2026-08-16, 104 files. Regenerable and nothing
# reads them. Untracked on the operator's instruction 2026-09-06; the ignore
# rule is what makes it stick, since git rm --cached alone is undone by the
# next git add -A.
04-outputs/ta-reports/

